Error [E0311]: `upper` isn't a method on this value
  --> tests/ui/member_staged.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print(s.upper())
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: This `String` value has no instance method named `upper`
 Fix: Did you mean `to_upper`? `upper` is another language's name for the same operation
